# Clive's Hideaway needs four legendary creatures you control. Bot1 controls three (Cecil, General Chang and Tinybones), a Ornithopter
# (not legendary) and, since Bot2 controls Rograkh (legendary, but not Bot1's), nothing else: the ability resolves and plays nothing, so
# the Bolt stays exiled, face down, and Bot2 stays at 20. (Four creatures, or four legendary creatures counting Bot2's, would play it.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Clive's Hideaway
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Cecil, Dark Knight
General Chang, Cold Warrior
Tinybones, the Pickpocket
Mox Pearl
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Rograkh, Son of Rohgahh
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Clive's Hideaway.Play
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Island; Island; Island)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.General Chang, Cold Warrior.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Tinybones, the Pickpocket.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Rograkh, Son of Rohgahh.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Clive's Hideaway.Activate(Ability: You may play)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 1
Bot2.Life = 20
